  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some ISPs limit the data of their clients per month. New players with new models every day are becoming more and more expensive on the data side. I think having an option to have default skins already stored in VRChat to unknown players, the option to reveal their skin when selected, and to reveal skins of friends would be a great help in not only performance, but disabling skins of rather annoying nuisances and making a \"child friendly\" option for streamers.",
